{# Empty map box for a post's location, rendered so its aspect-ratio holds the space from first paint; place-map.js adopts it and starts the preloader. Expects mapPlace (optional). No-JS visitors get the place name's OpenStreetMap link in the meta line instead. #}
<div class="place-map-live" data-place-map-box>
  <p class="place-map-pending">{{ words.mapOfPlace | replace('{place}', mapPlace or words.thisPlace) }}</p>
</div>
